==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|на-|нести́}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|нанести́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-нанести.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|нанести́|pf|impf=наноси́ть}}

# to [[drift]] (on); to [[carry]], to waft, to deposit, to wash ashore (e.g. of snow, sand, etc.)
# to [[mark]] (on); to [[draw]] (e.g. onto a map)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''нанести́''' [[на]] [[карта|ка́рту]]|to mark/draw on a map}}
# to [[inflict]] (on); to [[cause]] (to); to [[bring]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''нанести́''' [[оскорбле́ние]]|to insult}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''нанести́''' [[уще́рб]]|to cause damage}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''нанести́''' [[уда́р]]|to strike, to deliver a blow}}
# to [[bring]] {{gloss|too much of something}}
# to [[lay]] (eggs, a lot)
# to [[apply]] (cream, ointment, make-up, etc.)
# (''in expressions'')
#: {{uxi|ru|'''нанести́''' [[визи́т]]|to pay a visit}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|7b/b(9)+p|нанести́|нанес}}
